    "raw": "...long held as the finest wine in the known galaxy, Mantizian vineyards are viewed with utmost respect by virtually all respected wine connosieurs. Few are those among the elite who are not familiar with the narcotic qualities of these wines. Highly sought, their value on the black market is insultingly astronomical.",
    "value": "....甲虫族葡萄园长久以来被视为已知银河系中最上乘的葡萄酒产地，几乎受到所有知名品鉴家的极高推崇。精英阶层中鲜有人不熟悉这类酒的麻醉特性。因其极为抢手，黑市上的价格已高到令人发指。"
